u in danger, he discovers a new drug is behind the entire problem. Murders become rampant. The new drug is constantly tied to the murders, but there is not enough evidence to prove it. Will the beautiful girls he becomes involved with help him solve the mystery?  \n  \nImportant:  \n1. Mount Chain - The Lost Footprints.ccd1 With Daemon Tools.  \n2. Open the virtual drive and start CHAINUST.exe as administrator.  \n3. Install the game.  \n4. Keep the cd mounted and play.  \n5. If you want to remove mosaics, extract the patch and paste the files CHAINUS.exe and HCG in the game directory.  \n  \nSystem Requirements:  \n350 MB hard drive, 32 MB Memory, Pentium II or higher processor recommended, DirectX compatible graphics and sound card.  \n  \nScreenshots:  \n![Image](http://s3.amazonaws.com/images3.jlist.com/g9/GC004_7.jpg)  \n![Image](http://s6.postimg.org/m2ol6zo8x/58061f8c85ceb3a5a4969739a5b3b3aa.jpg)  \n![Image](https://s.vndb.org/sf/71/12671.jpg)  \n![Image](https://s.vndb.org/sf/06/77806.jpg)  \n![Image](https://s.vndb.org/sf/07/77807.jpg)"}
